---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import BookletApp from '../components/BookletApp';
---

<Layout
  title="Free PDF to Booklet Converter & Imposition Tool - 100% Client-Side"
  description="Convert standard vertical single-page PDFs into landscape 2-up spreads formatted as booklets or multi-page signatures. Fast, private, and runs entirely in your browser."
  canonicalUrl="https://pdf-to-booklet.pages.dev/"
>
  <section class="hero-section">
    <div class="container">
      <h1 class="hero-title"><span class="gradient-text">PDF to Booklet</span> Converter</h1>
      <p class="hero-subtitle">
        Impose your single-page PDFs into landscape 2-up spreads for professional printing and folding.
        All processing occurs locally in your browser—<strong>your files never leave your computer</strong>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Interactive App React Island -->
  <section class="app-section">
    <BookletApp client:load defaultPreset="auto" defaultMode="signature" />
  </section>

  <!-- Informational SEO Section -->
  <section class="info-section">
    <div class="info-container">
      <div class="info-card">
        <h3>100% In-Browser Privacy</h3>
        <p>
          Unlike other web utilities that upload your documents to third-party servers, PrintBooklet parses and processes your files locally using Web Workers. Perfect for confidential documents, books, and booklets.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="info-card">
        <h3>Eliminate Inversion Bugs</h3>
        <p>
          Printer drivers often invert pages on the short-edge when printing booklets. Our side-by-side positioning embeds pages onto the landscape canvas with a strict $0^\circ$ rotation lock, preventing upside-down prints.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="info-card">
        <h3>High-Performance Web Workers</h3>
        <p>
          Powered by HTML5 Web Workers, our processing engine manipulates raw file bytes in a background thread, preventing UI freezing even when compiling documents with hundreds of pages.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="guide-section">
    <div class="guide-container">
      <h2>How to Print Your Booklets & Signatures</h2>
      <div class="steps-grid">
        <div class="step-card">
          <div class="step-num">1</div>
          <h4>Impose Your PDF</h4>
          <p>Select your booklet mode and target paper size. Upload your single-page PDF and download the imposed landscape PDF spreads.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step-card">
          <div class="step-num">2</div>
          <h4>Double-Sided Printing</h4>
          <p>Print the output PDF using your printer's double-sided (duplex) option. <strong>Set the flipping edge to Long-Edge Binding</strong> (Landscape).</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step-card">
          <div class="step-num">3</div>
          <h4>Fold and Staple</h4>
          <p>Stack the printed sheets in order, fold them directly down the center fold line, and saddle-stitch (staple) along the crease.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .hero-section {
    padding: 3rem 1.5rem 1rem 1.5rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .container {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .hero-title {
    font-size: 3rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.15;
  }

  .hero-subtitle {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .app-section {
    width: 100%;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  /* Info Section */
  .info-section {
    background-color: var(--bg-secondary);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    padding: 4rem 1.5rem;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .info-container {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .info-card {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    padding: 2rem;
    border-radius: 12px;
  }

  .info-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .info-card p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  /* Guide Section */
  .guide-section {
    padding: 4rem 1.5rem;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 1200px;
  }

  .guide-container {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .guide-container h2 {
    font-size: 2.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .steps-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 2rem;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .step-card {
    position: relative;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    background: var(--bg-secondary);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    border-radius: 12px;
  }

  .step-num {
    position: absolute;
    top: -1.25rem;
    left: 1.5rem;
    background: var(--accent-blue);
    color: white;
    width: 2.5rem;
    height: 2.5rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    border-radius: 50%;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.4);
  }

  .step-card h4 {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .step-card p {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .hero-title {
      font-size: 2.25rem;
    }

    .info-container,
    .steps-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
